{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"马太福音","commonName":"马太福音","title":"马太福音","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"8c561b40b5713bc2a17d261e98e16e4b78a3d6d2d0d0018dae6b936c1261e8f2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1071},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["之后，施洗者约翰出现，在犹太的荒野中传道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他说：“悔改吧，因为天国已降临。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["约翰便是以赛亚先知曾预言的那个人。预言曾说：在荒野一个声音在呼喊：“预备主的道，修直他的路！”",{"noteId":11}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["约翰身穿驼毛衣服，腰束皮带，以蝗虫",{"noteId":12},"和野蜜为食。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["人们从耶路撒冷、犹太全地和约旦河一带赶来，来到他的身边，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["向他忏悔自己的罪，在约旦河中接受他的施洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但约翰看见很多法利赛人和撒都该人也来此受洗，便对他们说：“你们乃毒蛇之子，谁告诉你们可以逃离那即将到来的审判？",{"noteId":13}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你们要拿出行动，证明真心悔改。",{"noteId":14}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["不要心中暗自产生傲慢的想法：‘亚伯拉罕就是我们的祖先。’我告诉你们，上帝可以用这些石头创造亚伯拉罕的后裔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["事实上，砍树的斧子已经准备好，所有结不出好果子的树，都会被砍倒丢入火中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["是的，我是用水为你们施洗，显示你们的悔改。但在我之后，还会出现一位比我更伟大之人，我甚至连替他提鞋的资格都没有，他将用圣灵和火为你们施洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他手里拿着簸谷工具",{"noteId":15},"，他将清理打谷场，把麦子收进谷仓，然后用不灭之火把谷壳烧尽。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["这时，耶稣从加利利来到约旦河，走到约翰处准备接受他的施洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["约翰想要阻止他，说：“我本应由受你施洗，你却要让我来为你施洗吗？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["耶稣答道：“请这样做吧。我们应遵循上帝说是正确之事。”于是约翰便答应下来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["当耶稣受洗后从水中立起；忽然天空敞开，他看见上帝之灵降落，如鸽子般落在他身上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["天空传来一个声音，说：“这是吾子，",{"noteId":16},"他让我欢喜。”"]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"见《以赛亚书》40:3。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":3}},{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"此处也可能是槐豆，与“蝗虫”拼写相近。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":4}},{"noteId":13,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“愤怒。”","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":7}},{"noteId":14,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“结出可以进行忏悔的果子”之意。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":8}},{"noteId":15,"caller":"+","text":"收获粮食后，人们在这里将谷物去壳。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":12}},{"noteId":16,"caller":"+","text":"或“这是吾子，我的爱子。”","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/MAT/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/MAT/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/MAT/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}